      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To uncover more subtle patterns, consider analyzing the frequency and magnitude of these discrepancies across various months, vendors, or departments. You can use variance analysis to see if similar discrepancies appear in the same vendors or departments, and assess the size of the discrepancies in KPI terms (e.g., dollars or percentage of total expenses). You can also look at discrepancies over time to see if they're trending upward or downward.",
